    "enUS": {
      "description": "Here's Kravel's package, {name}.  And when you deliver it, tell him... if he wants more special orders, then he'll have to pay his tab!",
      "dialogue": {
        "0977a877e44ab5a90360": "Did you make it to Ratchet and get those parts?",
        "984e5bed00214962f141": "Here's Kravel's package, $N.  And when you deliver it, tell him... if he wants more special orders, then he'll have to pay his tab!",
        "c3c8519434ba34b011ed": "Great, you got them!  Now we need to get them to the gnomes.  But first...$B$BLet's take out one small item..."
      },
